*.dll binary
*.nupkg binary
*.msi binary
*.msix binary
*.appx binary
*.pdb binary
*.snk binary
*.winmd binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mov binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.flv binary
*.fla binary
*.swf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.woff binary
*.pyc binary
*.pdf binary
*.ez binary
*.bz2 binary
*.swp binary
*.pfx binary
